d to some of the others  luffy for his part shows off a bit using  his speed to weave  through the wind slashes and then  unleash his kong rifle  seemingly an upgraded version of kong  gun and i gotta say i love how  straightforward luffy's upgraded move  names are  as someone who used to play a lot of  counter-strike i can't wait to see the  kong  up the point being though luffy's  improved attack  does damage and sends kaido flying  backwards this david vs goliath story is  looking very good right now  as david is punching around goliath kid  comes in for a combo and slams kaido  into the ground it looks cool but i  wonder how useful  such purely physical moves like kids can  hope to be against kaido  luffy's got that advanced hockey going  but kids still need something some  special  angle that we have yet to see obviously  kaido gets up  fine and next law has his turn against  the ankle he's never dissected a dragon  before as he says but he tries to guess  where kaido's heart  is and whips out a gamma knife against  him this has been called law's strongest  technique and it can be used to fatally  wound opponents by destroying their  internal organs in other words it should  render kaido's tough skin meaningless  because the move just passes through it  kaido is not defeated as you'd expect  but still he is hurt  and has to admit that these guys can  counter his durability and thus they are  not the suicidal fools  he took them for these kinds of lines  that acknowledge however hesitantly  that the supernova are more of a threat  than the yonko  thought at first get me so hyped up the  thing is  we don't know for sure what internal  organs law actually hit  and how much damage that will do against  kaido compared to other people but we do  know that kaido's dragon form is  actually a good counter to law's ability  because as mentioned it is much harder  to find the heart of a dragon than it is  to find the heart of a human  killer's up next and i don't mean to  anger any hardcore killer fans but i  think most of us expected the least from  him because he's not a captain and he's  not  zoro he tries to cut kaido's scales and  nothing happens  however to our surprise killer decides  he can get through by slicing kaido  up from the inside he uses sonic's  scythe  an attack that seemingly creates  sound-based blades that travel through a  tough hide  and the attack appears to do real damage  across kaido's  entire body killer being able to hurt a  yonko was not  expected and wow i have to say i look at  killer differently now  however just as things seem to be going  too good to be true  big mom blasts killer with some  lightning the move is named indra who  according to google  is the deity of the heavens lightning  thunderstorms rains river flows and war  the god and nature references continue  and this one is pretty epic  kid is shocked to see what happened to  killer not quite as shocked as killer  obviously but still shocked big mom  is truly terrifying here as we see her  from above laughing and saying  as if she were a vengeful god that there  will be no escape for anyone under the  heavens  kaido has to admit that these supernova  are tougher than expected and as he's  about to gobble up  killer luffy gives him another hit as  luffy is moving through the air  seemingly defenseless kaido prepares a  fire blast what i'm about to mention is  the most hilarious moment in the chapter  zoro asks law for a boost after him  having to follow luffy aka another  captain's orders last time  this time zoro is even giving law orders  and even though law does it and knows  it's the right thing to do he's still  upset because of how it looks and  proclaims he's not a babysitter as he  sends  zorro up there to slice kaido's blast  breath zorro is just so  epic first he commanded law then he cut  kaido's fire after cutting prometheus  previously  and now he goes to seriously attack  kaido a moment we've all been waiting  for  last time he did little damage but we  all knew he'd come back with a better  slice  and this is it with enma odin's old  sword zoro prepares his attack  even kaido is intimidated and saying  nani and big mom  so confident in herself a second ago is  actually freaking out telling kaido to  dodge  the move has a great name it's called  flying dragon blaze  but unfortunately it doesn't land but it  does cleanly slice off a horn  on the giant skull of onigashima but it  didn't even have to hit kaido for this  to be one of the most epic moments ever  two yonko were scared kaido the  unkillable  felt like he had to dodge an attack and  it wasn't even an attack from a captain  zorro continues to impress and i really  can't get enough of his character  now to be fair big mom does single out  the sword saying that's not your average  sword and kaido wonders why odin's aura  is emanating from that same sword so  enma definitely deserves some credit  here as a blade  and one of the reasons i think it will  be the key to beating kaido is because  psychologically the blade and odin's  memory  will lower kaido's defenses as well but  props still have to go to zorro and even  big mom says that kaido really  underestimated him  i do want to know what you guys make of  the whole odin's aura emanating from his  sword thing  is it psychological is zoro giving off  the same energy as odin or is odin's  power and will somehow inside  the sword itself i'd love to hear your  thoughts because i'm not sure how to  interpret this right now  zorro despite doing something super epic  is still  furious he missed and gets zapped by  lightning-like killer  his defense is not as strong as his  offense while for luffy he's unaffected  by the attack  because he is rubber after all so  despite big mom turning the entire  battlefield into a deadly lightning  storm and even calling the attack  heavenly dominion shiva's wrath luffy is  still fine like in the seven deadly sins  luffy is not afraid to stand up and  fight against the so-called gods of this  world  kid mentions that the attack is like a  natural disaster and he gets hit along  with law  big mom is shocked that luffy is fine  and he jumps towards the yonko he gets  hit by blast breath and kaido in turn is  shocked when it looks like fire isn't  effective either against luffy as if  this was a pokemon game  but no luffy says that time he kept  going because of guts  and he uses kong gatling to pummel  kaido mercilessly with countless punches  and that is it for this chapter which  passed by super quick because it was so  action-packed  what an amazing chapter kaido did not  look good here  obviously this happened sometimes and  then the next chapter he may absolutely  wreck everyone you never know but he  definitely wasn't as impressive as you  might expect in this chapter at least  he was punched around by luffy a lot  hurt by  killer hurt by law and had to straight  up dodge an attack from zorro  big mom's lightning was truly impressive  and only  luffy could get up and fight right away  afterwards some notable highlights for  me in this chapter were killer doing  better than expected  obviously zoro's epic moment was my  favorite big mom's god-like power was  crazy  and luffy's ability to keep going and  punch around kaido  so much was notable too clearly as of  right now  zoro seems to have the most destructive  potential against  kaido as i expected he would but that  isn't everything and luffy shined more  in endurance this chapter  being able to take attacks and keep  going for me though luffy and zoro are  still the clear stars of this battle  and we'll see how much more lock killer  and especially kid can do  since kid doesn't even have a real way  to hurt kaido yet  and he talked the most about crushing  him for that reason i feel like we will  see  something epic from kids soon as long as  the upcoming chapters aren't dealing  with solely other parts of the story  also kaido is probably gonna bounce 